People use today's living standards to predict how the poor will live after AI explosion. 

They forget that their is difference between living conditions of poor people in differenr eras.

In older times, a lower middle class family would be able to eat meat less food daily(only the lowest quality flour and rice, not the normal or good one) 

Would have small clay house where they would sleep on husk with mosquitoes and the summer heat. and wake up daily to work for 10 or so hours daily 350 or more days a year. Rarely any of the lower middle class had any means of transport. 

And die in their 40s or 50s after suffering from a work related disease/condition.



Now compare that to lower middle class of today. 
We live better than the Upper middle class of that time atleast in every single way. 

And in most ways better than the upper class too.

